From 6833e4b0a55974ca0d631ba6a5b158f89bf9ab97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sv. Lockal" <lockalsash@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Oct 2025 05:15:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix missing include for int8_t/int16_t (gcc-16)

Closes #49.

Signed-off-by: Sv. Lockal <lockalsash@gmail.com>
